# The change is owed to every silo but never delivered to one that did not
# serve the admin call, so its stale entry is never evicted.
MODULE: StaleEventuallyEvictedNeverDelivered
TARGET: StaleEventuallyEvicted
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: propagation to a non-admin silo never happens
PERTURBS: Propagate

--- FIND
Propagate(s) ==
    /\ pending[s]
--- REPLACE
Propagate(s) ==
    /\ pending[s] /\ s = adminAt
--- END
